<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-117.1-ps-mark-licensing-vendor-certification-and-product-standards-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3665" name="W3665. DTI-BPS Certification Program Strategy &amp; Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual compliance planning (links to VS-22.3/VS-33.1); regulatory change; program review
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise DTI-BPS certification program
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Regulatory Officer (links to VS-22), Merchandising/Category Mgrs (links to VS-01), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Import/Customs (links to VS-87/VS-02.2), Quality (links to VS-31), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Cross-Entity Shared Services (links to VS-72), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3665 — DTI-BPS Certification Program Strategy &amp; Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3665_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3665_Lane1" name="Product Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3665_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3665_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3665_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3665_Lane2" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3665_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3665_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3665_Start4" name="Annual compliance planning (links to VS-22.3/VS-33.1); regulatory change; program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3665_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3665_Task5" name="Product Compliance Manager/Regulatory Officer define the DTI-BPS certification…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager/Regulatory Officer define the DTI-BPS certification program strategy and governance: scope (regulated product categories — steel, cement, PVC, electrical, ceramics, gypsum, paint, chemicals), the instrument map (PS Mark License for local manufacture, ICC per import shipment, SOC for PS-licensed foreign makers), the regulatory map (RA 4109, DTI-BPS DAOs, PCIMS portal, Consumer Act RA 7394), the operating model, and KPIs (regulatory non-conformance rate, ICC cycle-time, PS-license currency, sticker integrity, market-surveillance findings)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3665_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3665_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3665_Task6" name="Product Compliance Manager establish the governance: Product Compliance Manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Product Compliance Manager establish the governance: Product Compliance Manager authority, the cross-functional responsibilities (Merchandising gates assortment, Vendor Mgmt manages license, Import coordinates ICC, Quality runs sampling, Legal advises), the certification policy, and the integration to regulatory compliance (VS-22), merchandising (VS-01), vendor management (VS-03), and customs (VS-87)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3665_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3665_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3665_Task7" name="VP Legal/CFO ratify the certification strategy and policy, approve the program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Legal/CFO ratify the certification strategy and policy, approve the program budget (links to VS-17.4), and report certification posture and regulatory exposure to the executive risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36) and board (links to VS-36); communicate the mandate
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Product Compliance Manager
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3665_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3665_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3665_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3665_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-157 (ensure PS Mark / ICC certification coverage.) | - operational: Product Compliance Manager authority; operational: standards monitoring (W3671)
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3665_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3665_Annotation9" targetRef="W3665_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3665_Flow11" sourceRef="W3665_Start4" targetRef="W3665_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3665_Flow12" sourceRef="W3665_Task5" targetRef="W3665_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3665_Flow13" sourceRef="W3665_Task6" targetRef="W3665_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3665_Flow14" sourceRef="W3665_Task7" targetRef="W3665_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3665_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3665_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3665">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3665_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3665_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
