    <bpmn:process id="W_W3668" name="W3668. Product Standards Technical File &amp; Documentation Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Certification application (links to W3669/W3673); audit; regulatory inspection
Frequency: Per regulated product + maintained
Volume: Technical file per regulated SKU/vendor
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Quality
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Records (links to VS-88), Merchandising (links to VS-01)
Source: workflow W3668 — Product Standards Technical File &amp; Documentation Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3668_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3668_Lane1" name="Product Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3668_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3668_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3668_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3668_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3668_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3668_Start3" name="Certification application (links to W3669/W3673); audit; regulatory inspection">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3668_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3668_Task4" name="Product Compliance Manager/Quality compile and maintain the product standards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager/Quality compile and maintain the product standards technical file per regulated product: product specifications, applicable PNS/DAO, test reports, factory quality system evidence, PS License/ICC certificates, drawings/labels, and the declaration of conformity; manage version control and the document taxonomy (links to VS-88)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Quality / Records
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Per product + maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3668_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3668_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3668_Task5" name="Product Compliance Manager manage label/mark compliance: verify the PS Mark/ICC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Product Compliance Manager manage label/mark compliance: verify the PS Mark/ICC mark is correctly applied to product and packaging per BPS marking rules, language/labeling per Consumer Act RA 7394 (links to VS-01.3/W1345), and that the ICC sticker obligation is met (links to W3678)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Quality
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Per product</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3668_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3668_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3668_Task6" name="Product Compliance Manager/Records retain the technical file per regulatory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Product Compliance Manager/Records retain the technical file per regulatory retention (links to VS-88), support DTI-BPS inspection and audit response (links to W3682/W3672), and manage document legal-hold where a certification matter is in dispute (links to VS-100/VS-88.2)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Records / Legal
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3668_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3668_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3668_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3668_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-580 (ensure controlled execution — PS Mark Licensing, Vendor Certification &amp; Product Standards Governance (PA-117.1).) | - operational: technical-file discipline; operational: label-compliance verification
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Quality</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
