    <bpmn:process id="W_W3670" name="W3670. Vendor Certification Audit, Verification &amp; PS License Renewal" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Renewal cycle (W3667); risk-based audit; market-surveillance finding
Frequency: Per vendor + periodic
Volume: Regulated-category vendors
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Quality
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Vendor Scorecard (links to VS-67), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3670 — Vendor Certification Audit, Verification &amp; PS License Renewal</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3670_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3670_Lane1" name="Product Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3670_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3670_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3670_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3670_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3670_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3670_Start3" name="Renewal cycle (W3667); risk-based audit; market-surveillance finding">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3670_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3670_Task4" name="Product Compliance Manager/Quality verify PS License authenticity and scope…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager/Quality verify PS License authenticity and scope with DTI-BPS (online registry / direct confirmation) for new and renewed vendors, and conduct risk-based vendor certification audits (factory, quality system, marking, test-report validity) on high-risk regulated-category vendors
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Quality / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Per vendor + periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3670_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3670_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3670_Task5" name="Product Compliance Manager/Vendor Mgmt manage the PS License renewal lifecycle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Product Compliance Manager/Vendor Mgmt manage the PS License renewal lifecycle: trigger vendor renewal 90 days pre-expiry, coordinate factory re-audit and BPS re-issuance, track renewal to completion, and gate continued sourcing on renewal
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Per renewal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3670_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3670_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3670_Task6" name="Product Compliance Manager manage certification non-conformance found at audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Product Compliance Manager manage certification non-conformance found at audit: corrective action, re-test, re-marking, and where serious, stop-sell (links to W3684) and vendor delisting consideration (links to VS-67/W2466); report to audit (links to VS-21) and scorecard (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Quality / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: On finding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3670_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3670_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3670_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3670_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-157 (ensure PS Mark / ICC certification coverage.) | - operational: registry verification; operational: 90-day pre-expiry trigger
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Quality</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
