    <bpmn:process id="W_W3671" name="W3671. BPS Standards Monitoring &amp; Regulatory Change Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: DTI-BPS publication; DAO/standard change; PCIMS portal change
Frequency: Continuous + on publication
Volume: BPS regulatory pipeline
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Regulatory Officer (links to VS-22.3), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Government Affairs (links to VS-104)
Source: workflow W3671 — BPS Standards Monitoring &amp; Regulatory Change Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3671_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3671_Lane1" name="Product Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3671_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3671_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3671_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3671_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3671_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3671_Start3" name="DTI-BPS publication; DAO/standard change; PCIMS portal change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3671_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3671_Task4" name="Product Compliance Manager/Regulatory Officer monitor the DTI-BPS regulatory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager/Regulatory Officer monitor the DTI-BPS regulatory pipeline: new/updated PNS, DAOs adding/removing products from mandatory certification, ICC/SOC procedural changes, PCIMS portal updates, sticker/fee changes, and market-surveillance programs (Oplan); source via DTI-BPS channels, associations (links to VS-104.2), and regulatory intelligence
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3671_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3671_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3671_Task5" name="Product Compliance Manager assess the impact of each regulatory change on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Product Compliance Manager assess the impact of each regulatory change on BuildRight&#x27;s regulated-product register (W3666), vendors (W3667), and in-market stock; determine the compliance action (re-certify, re-test, re-mark, sell-down, withdraw) and the deadline; integrate to enterprise regulatory-change management (links to VS-22.3)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Merchandising / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: On change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3671_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3671_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3671_Task6" name="Product Compliance Manager execute the change: update the standards mapping…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Product Compliance Manager execute the change: update the standards mapping (W3666), brief merchandising/vendors, drive re-certification, and report regulatory-change impact and posture to governance (links to VS-22.3/VS-36) and government-affairs intelligence (links to VS-104)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: On change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3671_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3671_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3671_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3671_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-157 (ensure PS Mark / ICC certification coverage.) | - operational: continuous monitoring and association intelligence; operational: certification goes unnoticed; operational: impact assessment and deadline tracking
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Regulatory Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3671_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3671_Annotation8" targetRef="W3671_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
