    <bpmn:process id="W_W3672" name="W3672. Certification Records, Reporting &amp; Program Audit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual audit cycle; DTI-BPS inspection; program review
Frequency: Annual + on event
Volume: Program documentation and records
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Audit
Participants: Product Compliance Manager, Audit (links to VS-21), Records (links to VS-88), Regulatory Officer (links to VS-22), Quality (links to VS-31), Compliance (links to VS-22), Cross-Entity (links to VS-72)
Source: workflow W3672 — Certification Records, Reporting &amp; Program Audit</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3672_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3672_Lane1" name="Product Compliance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3672_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3672_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3672_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3672_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3672_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3672_Start3" name="Annual audit cycle; DTI-BPS inspection; program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3672_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3672_Task4" name="Product Compliance Manager/Records maintain the certification documentation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Product Compliance Manager/Records maintain the certification documentation: regulated-product register (W3666), PS-license register (W3667), technical files (W3668), ICC/SOC certificates and stickers (W3673/W3678), market-surveillance correspondence (W3682), and vendor recovery/penalty records (W3686); retention per VS-88 and regulation
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Records
Accountable (A): Product Compliance Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3672_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3672_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3672_Task5" name="Product Compliance Manager/Audit conduct the annual certification-program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Product Compliance Manager/Audit conduct the annual certification-program audit: register accuracy (W3666), license currency (W3667), in-market compliance (W3681), sticker integrity (W3678), documentation completeness (W3668), and gating effectiveness (W3669); internal and (where required) external
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3672_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3672_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3672_Task6" name="Product Compliance Manager manage findings to closure, support DTI-BPS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Product Compliance Manager manage findings to closure, support DTI-BPS inspection/audit response (links to VS-22.2/W77) and Consumer-Act defense (links to VS-100), and report audit posture to the audit committee (links to VS-21/VS-36) and governance (W3665)
Responsible (R): Product Compliance Manager / Audit / Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3672_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3672_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3672_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3672_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-157 (ensure PS Mark / ICC certification coverage.) | - operational: documentation discipline; operational: gating effectiveness audit
Owner: Product Compliance Manager / Audit</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3672_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3672_Annotation8" targetRef="W3672_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
